<title>HONG KONG: Kawasan Industri in US$150 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Kawasan Industri in US$150 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Kawasan Industri Jababeka has mandated Nomura International Hong Kong and Peregrine Fixed Income to arrange a US$150 million floating-rate note issue, bankers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The three-year facility will be launched into general syndication via a special-purpose company, but no pricing details were yet available.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
